        "text": "**Chapter 2: Why Linux \u2013 What are the Benefits?**\n\nChapter two answers the burning question that you really need to know before going out and just\ninstalling a new operating system: Why do it and what does Linux actually offer me?\n\n**Table of Contents**\n\n  - **[So what does Linux actually offer me then?](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-2-why-linux-whats-the-benefits/#So_what_does_Linux_actually_offer_me_then)**\n\n  - **[Linux is an Open Source Operating System (oh, and it\u2019s free too!)](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-2-why-linux-whats-the-benefits/#Linux_is_an_Open_Source_Operating_System_oh_and_its_free_too)**\n\n  - **[Give your old hardware a new lease of life](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-2-why-linux-whats-the-benefits/#Give_your_old_hardware_a_new_lease_of_life)**\n\n  - **[Security and privacy is built in by default](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-2-why-linux-whats-the-benefits/#Security_and_privacy_is_built_in_by_default)**\n\n  - **[Customisation and modification galore](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-2-why-linux-whats-the-benefits/#Customisation_and_modification_galore)**\n\n  - **[Some of the greatest software comes from Linux and Open Source](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-2-why-linux-whats-the-benefits/#Some_of_the_greatest_software_comes_from_Linux_and_Open_Source)**",
